<v Ira Glass>《美国生活》由国际公共广播电台发行。

00:58:04.730 --> 00:58:20.500
<v Ira Glass>[FUNDING CREDITS]
<v Ira Glass>[赞助商致谢]

00:58:20.500 --> 00:58:29.160
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who always says to me when he passes me in the hallway, particularly when I'm filing in the lower drawers,
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ电台管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责，当他在走廊经过我时，特别是当我正在处理底层抽屉的文件时，他总会对我说，

00:58:29.160 --> 00:58:31.100
<v Woman>Hello, baby.
<v Woman>你好，宝贝。

00:58:31.100 --> 00:58:56.370
<v David Rakoff>I'm David Rakoff. Ira Glass will be back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v David Rakoff>我是大卫·拉科夫。伊拉·格拉斯下周将带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

00:58:56.370 --> 00:59:01.370
